```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

August 3, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-23-21 for a Contract between the City of Cheyenne and
Kaiser Corporation d/b/a Kaiser Flooring, for the Municipal Building 3rd Floor
Carpet Replacement Project
______________________________________________
Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Two (2) bids were received from:

1. Kaiser Flooring.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
2. Commercial Flooring / Carpet One Floor & Home.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The bids were reviewed by Vicki Nemecek (Public Works), and Steve Gaer (Facilities).

Their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Kaiser Corporation d/b/a Kaiser
Flooring, for a total bid award amount of $73,233.00.

Funding:
001-21-2113-40-32107 (General Fund / Capital Improvement Expenses)

Grand Total $73,233.00
```

